#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""ccfleet CLI: original Claude Code with the user's selected hosted accounts.

The local process owns no provider credential. A configured gateway sends model
requests directly over HTTPS using a separate revocable endpoint key, without a
local HTTP listener or laptop SSH. Explicit legacy bridge launches use an
authenticated WSS byte path and pinned OpenSSH to the assigned slot. Remote
terminal sessions retain their existing forced SSH/tmux entry. Files, tools,
preferences and native Claude history remain local for the ``local`` command.
"""

